title: Stopover
text: A teleporter does not care where it was meant to send you. It sends you to the first one it finds.
trick: a mobile teleporter dropped between a fixed pair catches the red jump halfway (so a quad bender can feed the starburst diagonally), and later throws blue back out of the far teleporter onto the red laser's own line
motif: open field
proof: not proved; no other solution found in 300 s
expect: depth>=4
